{
  "title": "Beyond the Shore's End",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Beyond the Shore&#39;s End</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Chapter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_I\" title=\"Chapter I\">Chapter I</a>: Act VIII - <a href=\"/wiki/To_the_Shore%27s_End\" title=\"To the Shore&#39;s End\">To the Shore's End</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advance_toward_the_Future_from_Today\" title=\"Advance toward the Future from Today\">Advance toward the Future from Today</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Through_the_Sea_Thou_Break\" title=\"Through the Sea Thou Break\">Through the Sea Thou Break</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shorekeeper\" title=\"Shorekeeper\">Shorekeeper</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Beyond the Shore's End</b> is the eighth act in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_I\" title=\"Chapter I\">Chapter I</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Summary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Summary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Summary\">Summary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shorekeeper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Shorekeeper\">The Shorekeeper</a> warns you of <a href=\"/wiki/Abby\" title=\"Abby\">Abby</a>'s anomalies. Through your intervention, the <a href=\"/wiki/Tethys_System\" title=\"Tethys System\">Tethys System</a> has returned to its rightful state, now operating with peaceful and harmonious frequencies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Wait for a while</li>\n<li>(Optional) Adjust the time to two days later</li>\n<li>Head to the Greenhouse and find the Shorekeeper</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Earth returns to earth, and ashes to ashes. The wandering souls within the Tethys System have finally found their peace, and the Shorekeeper is now free, thanks to your efforts. She wishes to speak with you—there's something she must share, something that concerns you directly.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Enter the Greenhouse)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/87/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_5.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061716\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_5.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_5.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> About that frequency dwelling within you...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> You mean Abby?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/2/24/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_7.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061717\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_7.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_7.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> Yes.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/7b/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_8.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061718\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_8.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_8.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> It seems to be \"hungering\" for something.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/86/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_9.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061719\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_9.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_9.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> Have you ever felt anything unusual?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> I don't feel anything...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Abby's been unusually quiet these days.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/77/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_12.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061720\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_12.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_12.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> My Sonoro can sense even the most minor changes in frequencies.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/cd/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_13.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061721\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_13.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_13.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> So I can tell that there's something strange about that frequency.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fa/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_14.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061723\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_14.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_14.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> I'll search for more information in the Tethys System and share what I find with you.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> How is the Tethys System now?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b3/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_16.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061724\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_16.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_16.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> After being fixed, it's executing the master command given at its creation.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a0/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_17.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061725\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_17.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_17.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> The core computational unit has now been replaced by a special frequency that shares similar properties as the Lament.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_18.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061726\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_18.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_18.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> But this one is... more harmonious and mild.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What about you? Are you still confined to this place?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/79/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_20.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061728\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_20.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_20.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> ...No.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/96/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_21.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061729\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_21.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_21.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> Although I must stay here to watch over the Black Shores, I'm now able to bath in the sunshine and feel the sea breeze with you.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> This is what freedom feels like.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/ce/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_23.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061730\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_23.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_23.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> It feels delightful.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/66/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_24.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061732\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_24.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_24.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> I know you have your own journey to finish.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_25.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061733\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_25.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_25.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> You can entrust the Black Shores to me, and I'll carry out my duty as always.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/75/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_26.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061734\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_26.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_26.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> You have the full support of the Black Shores, no matter where you are or how far you go.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ac/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_27.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061735\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_27.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_27.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> And... despite all the many names you bear, I see you for who you truly are.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3a/Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_28.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20240930061737\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_28.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_bsmq_1_3_699_28.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>The Shorekeeper:</b> Wherever your path leads, I hope to walk it with you.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Beyond the Shore's End</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">海岸尽头……之后</span>?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3